# Infra rules

## Overview
- UI: S3 + Cloudflare (`infra/terraform/envs/web`)
- Backend: `control_plane/` on EC2 + nginx (:80 → :8000) + RDS PostgreSQL (`infra/terraform/modules/data_plane`)
- API domain: `api.get1agent.com` → Cloudflare A record → EC2 Elastic IP
- EC2 port 80: Cloudflare IPs only. No SSH (port 22).
- App → DB: **IAM auth** (no password). DBeaver → SSM tunnel (`infra/aws/db-tunnel.sh`).

## Deploy scripts
- `infra/aws/deploy-all.sh` — infra + app
- `infra/aws/deploy-infra.sh` — Terraform only
- `infra/aws/deploy-control-plane.sh` — Docker → ECR → EC2 via SSM
- `infra/aws/db-tunnel.sh` — SSM port forward to RDS for DBeaver

Full guide: **`infra/DEPLOY.md`**

## GitHub secrets
- `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`, `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`
